17678", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974845_961945852084344_6533138472087779742_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PEFInzyeUfoQ7kNvwF2kLQE&_nc_oc=AdpJrYKo0Z0duXehSYsaj2jH-HrasAFT-ZQWBgIw_EEY_ar2EFgZJID0T-7BONFhbVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0MZv3RJGaQjU6BkgarhkVGuHjJkImzn6Iqv7tgRHRjWA&oe=69F1EB25"}, {"file_name": "stepseq2_1.22.2.png", "id": "250093507859189", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982503_250093511192522_4388969349790307505_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JI3wmZudhBgQ7kNvwGauurD&_nc_oc=Ado93vZMeUX1PCowIP_0qGwWsLibV1KLqQzAVCeHnF4nVBu44nJYAdXg5gnemZtqjlw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af33SBIkZaSZSKmVoN9wSlUOK28J8Fqfu1TXjrI1zhpGKw&oe=69F216C8"}, {"file_name": "Session_1.23.1.png", "id": "795767698985101", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001732_795767702318434_262560137887527662_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LJzrxqBpwgAQ7kNvwF2DLdt&_nc_oc=AdqezHu8cLOytWV89Fb-vGUl_GQ2FqxCU6NenbWoksmnLpx30X-kz2iKIAOXI5saj9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af17DpsT_ZuWtb4e0CUhtPG7N1pDITxNCLaImTGnMdnalw&oe=69F1F4FA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "tranzfirstframe.png", "id": "381471740929152", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_381471744262485_3617820370637424030_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vruN86QD2QEQ7kNvwFb5ZuW&_nc_oc=AdosknCbad57ft0dDW3DCUsKVYZhHaahAwXoMui81uYjd3fhVB5J1V11MiHpVI2y1l0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3YyShlavYaFXwhi1onmpefyakYy5Pj5dBsv6Aj_NfJEg&oe=69F2100E"}, "display_name": "Tranzient", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Make beats in VR - This is not a rhythm game!\n\nImmerse yourself in live looping and music production in VR.\n\n- Full support for hand tracking and mixed reality/passthrough \n- Synced looping with content library, auto time-stretched and pitch-shifted to fit the song.\n- Record vocals including mo-cap and replay of your avatar.\n- Use your custom Ready Player Me avatar.\n- Set of drum kits/one-shots.\n- Use Decks to create a seamless mix.\n- Full set of audio FX applied per clip or per scene (reverbs, chorus etc). \n- Loop record automation of audio FX parameters and synth parameters.\n- Assignable 3D control of FX and synth parameters.\n- Loop videos synced to the beat.\n- Step sequencer - trigger any item in the world and loop record instruments/drumkits. Edit steps, swing quantize.\n- Built in Analog Synth sim and Wavetable synth with >250 Sounds\n- Spatial Mixing - create a binaural mix based on clip positions.\n- In game camera and screen/mirror.\n\n\nIn the full version you get:\n- Built in 1.5 Gb library of loops and sounds\n- Use any number of synths (up to what the system can handle)\n- Use your own video and loops/samples\n- Export mixes of your performance\n- Lots more built in videos, VFX, Avatars and worlds.", "short_description": "The full version of Tranzient!\n\nMake beats in VR. Full live looping music production and sequencing environment in VR including visuals. \n\nThis is not a rhythm game.\n\nWho made the beats? You did!\n\nIn the full version you get:\n- Built in 1.5 Gb library of loops and sounds\n- Use any number of synths (up to what the system can handle)\n- Use your own video and loops/samples\n- Export mixes of your performance\n- Lots more built in videos, VFX, Avatars and worlds."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.aliveintech.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.aliveintech.com/eula", "publisher_name": "AliveIn Tech Ltd.", "support_website_url": "https://www.aliveintech.com/issues", "website_url": "https://aliveintech.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "conte